event publish:c7:III:02L8:targeted targeted proof check group=publish:c7:III:02L8 Complete pre-exposure derivation frozen 2026-11-24T23:41:19.206106+00:00 and fully root-reviewed before release. Derived same-germ original-cap/line/roof maps, primitive fibre sections and full fixed-sweep kernels; integral exterior on all 172 rows, every finite/regular order and free twist with norm maps, complete global bridge and dual groups. New raw-fixture program and all 729 output lines read. Proved nonzero-Chern product cap, primitive component complement, exact kernel k and signed pairing -b/q, all 282 patterns on 172 rows with 54 nonzero-Chern patterns, the full L+r bridge and zero-Euler case. Full primary/input and exposure scopes are recorded. Frozen fresh proof, program, output and data bytes are unchanged. Historical target algorithms/outputs remain unopened and uncredited. Shared evidence group supplies no extra independent-family count. No canonical/global mutation, build, full-PDF or rendered-page reading, unit closure or paper-gate credit; root admission pending.
event publish:c7:III:02L8:whole-original-used used and rechecked in this run group=publish:c7:III:02L8 After individual release, read the whole original statement and all 9 proof items; compared every clause and auxiliary. Read the complete receiver and focused final corrections. Post-exposure raw program/output verifies 396 zero-Chern occurrences (316 multiplicative plus 80 additive), all 46 nonzero-Chern area rows/gcds with integral Wang preimages, all folded ranks and initial angular isotropy. All theorem and auxiliary conclusions stand. The rank-five ker(w) preimage and primitive rank-one boundary kernel are related by explicit inverse maps; all seven D.OC identities stand. Eight label/target pairs and seven equation tags survive two separate exact guards. Exact local replay, balanced structures and TSV roundtrip passed; post-exposure work receives used/rechecked scope only. Full primary/input and exposure scopes are recorded. Frozen fresh proof, program, output and data bytes are unchanged. Historical target algorithms/outputs remain unopened and uncredited. Shared evidence group supplies no extra independent-family count. No canonical/global mutation, build, full-PDF or rendered-page reading, unit closure or paper-gate credit; root admission pending.
